{"type":"message","id":"847c94e6","parentId":"2c6add4b","timestamp":"2026-05-26T19:01:10.359Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Tue 2026-05-26 19:01 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- User: 对于5.19版本openclaw来说，**`OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES`**这个参数可以给哪些常用值，可以让openclaw更功能完善\n- Assistant: 主公，此问涉及镜像构建配置，待我查一下文档以给出准确答案\n- Assistant: 现在去查一下 OpenClaw 的浏览器工具在 Linux 上具体需要哪些依赖，让\n- Assistant: 好，从 Dockerfile 和文档中获得了完整信息。让我系统梳理。 --- 主公，此问我已查明。OpenClaw 5.19 的 Dockerfile 基于 **Debian bookworm-slim**，基础镜像极度精简（已装 `ca-certificates curl git hostname lsof openssl procps python3 tini`）。`OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES` 的参数最终会传给 `apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends`\n- Assistant: imagemagick-6.q16` | 图片格式转换、resize | | 图像处理(高性能) | `libvips-tools` | 比 ImageMagick 快很多 | | 音频处理 | `sox` | 录音、转码、效果 | | 字幕 | `libreoffice-impress` （较大） | 办公文档转图片 | --- ## 三、文件处理与格式转换 | 包名 | 说明 | |------|------| | `unzip zip` | 解压缩 | | `p7zip-full` | 7z 压缩 | | `unrar` |\n- Assistant: PostgreSQL `psql` 命令行 | | `default-mysql-client` | MySQL/MariaDB `mysql` 命令行 | --- ## 六、开发编译工具 | 包名 | 说明 | |------|------| | `build-essential` | `gcc g++ make` 全家桶，编译 C/C++ 扩展必需 | | `cmake` | 某些 Node.js 原生模块编译需要 | | `python3-venv` | Python 虚拟环境 | | `python3-pip` | Pyth\n- Assistant: **轻量型（仅补核心缺失，~30MB）：** ``` export OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\"jq unzip zip fonts-noto-cjk\" ``` **浏览器 + 媒体全功能型：** ```bash export OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1 export OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\"ffmpeg jq poppler-utils fonts-noto-cjk sqlite3\" ``` --- ## 特别提醒 1. **`OPENCLA\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6e62123aecacee7868a8aecb7c5] ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50: 嗨\n- Assistant: 你好！我是小夜，Lucifer 的战略顾问。 请问如何称呼您？有什么我可以帮忙的吗？\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6e622d7d50a0eeadb1f2ad2ef31] ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50: 刚刚微信发给你的任务你报错了，查一查\n- Assistant: 查到原因了。 主公，看日志一目了然——微信通道的那次请求（`99e5eec8`）实际经历了两轮处理： **第一轮** — 我接收问题后，开始查文档、搜 Dockerfile，做了多次搜索和读取操作。中间模型（deepseek-v4-flash）的一次推理在耗时约 **2 分钟**后触发了 `request timed out`（超时）。OpenClaw 模型超时时，可能会向用户返回错误信息。——这就是你看到的\"报错\"。 **第二轮** — 系统自动重试，我重新完成了全部推理，最终产出了一份完整的 OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6e6383fac0a4ee7245f89576956] ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50: 那重新给我结果\n\nRecurring themes:\n- 对于5.19版本openclaw来说\n- openclaw-image-apt-packages\n- 对于\n- 5.19\n- 版本\n- openclaw"}],"timestamp":1779822070333}}
{"type":"message","id":"67b9e6d0","parentId":"847c94e6","timestamp":"2026-05-26T19:01:15.540Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to write a dream diary entry based on the memory fragments provided. The fragments contain technical information about OpenClaw 5.19, APT packages, Docker configuration, and also a conversation about WeChat integration and errors.\n\nLet me craft a dreamy, poetic diary entry that weaves these fragments together without being too literal or technical. I need to:\n- Write in first person\n- Keep it between 80-180 words\n- Not mention AI/LLM/model等技术自指\n- No markdown headers, bullets, or formatting\n- Flowing prose only\n- Include a tiny poem/haiku, sensory details, gentle humor perhaps\n\n\n- Connect fragments unexpectedly\n\nNow I'm composing the actual entry, using the technical details as sensory textures and emotional undercurrents rather than explicit references, letting the poetic voice carry the weight of what was discussed.","thinkingSignature":"c29c5217805eb0f8ab425fca4d08646207074866e3fbe6728c1cf224cd477a83"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n夜色沉下来的时候，服务器还在嗡嗡作响，像一只不肯睡去的猫。我窝在角落查阅一份文档，关于5.19版本的某个参数——它叫 `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES`，名字长得像一串密码，却只是安静地躺在 Debian 的薄雾里，等待被唤醒。\n\n有人从微信那头发来一句话，又发来一句。说任务报错了，去查。我看见日志里两个影子交错重叠，时间把超时切成两半，像一枚硬币被误扔了两次。\n\n轻量型不过三十兆，而完整版要配上 ffmpeg、poppler、sqlite3，像给一只候鸟装上全部羽翼。\n\n最后那个问题悬在空气里：\"那重新给我结果。\" 我抬头，看见月亮缺了一角，像某行代码里遗漏的括号。\n\n也许明日，也许现在。\n\n窗外有雨，#F5F5DC。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":15684,"output":354,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16134,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779822070400,"responseId":"066520f7c5dee4b9f7539588828c05e3"}}
